WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.200
You don't have a reading problem. You have a keeping problem.

2
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:07.600
You highlighted half the book. You cannot teach one page of it.

3
00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:12.600
The ideas leaked because nothing in the week asked you to use them

4
00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:17.800
If you cannot say it, you did not keep it

5
00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:23.200
Remember this: the book is not finished when you close it

6
00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:28.200
Ask the shelf later. That is the whole practice.

7
00:00:28.200 --> 00:00:33.000
Don't just read. Build ideas. Keep the book in Albuc.

